::  name       mantra diff fields equality gate
::  shape      count - int (@u32) -> lawful - int (@u32)
::  invariant  answers 1 exactly when count is diff fields=3; answers 0 otherwise
::  example    3 -> 1 - 2 -> 0 - 4 -> 0
::  readers    Mantra - Glow Tend a1 unfinished - Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-e258-equality-seventh-v0 - STOA337
::
::  Ashvini equality - seventh pedestal gth cannot speak. The sur shape names
::  a Diff's three fields (site - inserts - deletes); this gate decides
::  *exactly*, not by a ceiling.
::
::  Moved two to three on 20260907.094747, the same lap and the same fault as
::  the fifth pedestal. The sur shape beside it had already moved on
::  20260906.212206; this desk had not, so two Glow desks named one fact and
::  disagreed, each green against its own copy of the number.
|=  sample=@u32
?:  (eq sample 3)  1  0
